        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Douglas SBD Dauntless, Curtiss SB2C Helldiver, Curtiss XSB3C\n- Events: Damage to Tama Maru No. 2 in World War II\n- Companies: Douglas Aircraft, Curtiss\n- Topics: American naval scout planes and dive bombers\n\nFacts:\n- During World War II, the Tama Maru No. 2 was damaged by the Douglas SBD Dauntless, an American naval scout plane and dive bomber.\n- Douglas Aircraft manufactured the Douglas SBD Dauntless.\n- The Curtiss SB2C Helldiver replaced the Douglas SBD Dauntless.\n- Curtiss, the maker of the Curtiss XSB3C, manufactured the Curtiss SB2C Helldiver.",
